# Contract Type

## Summary
The kinds of agreement the legal cards distinguish — `CONTRACT_TYPES`, their labels in `CONTRACT_TYPE_LABELS`, the `ContractTypeField` enum, and `contractTypeLabel(value)`. A Contract records its type with it, and a Signatory's `contractTypes` lists which kinds that person may sign, so the two read one vocabulary.

## Usage
```ts
import {
  ContractTypeField,
  contractTypeLabel,
} from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/legal/contract-type';

@field contractType = contains(ContractTypeField);
```

## Non-goals
No per-type templates or approval rules; those belong to the cards that use the type.
